PHASE 7A — Sales, Profitability & Reports
Engineering Cursor Spec
Date: 2026-06-27
Author: iOS + Backend Engineer role

ARCHITECTURE DECISIONS (resolved before implementation):

A. SaleEvent model — denormalized: stores itemName, itemSKU, storageName, category as strings at time of sale. Soft @Relationship to InventoryItem (optional, set to nil if item deleted). Historical data is never lost. Firestore path: users/{uid}/saleEvents/{saleId}

B. InventoryMovement model — stores itemId (UUID as String), itemName, storageName at time of movement. @Relationship to InventoryItem (optional). Firestore path: users/{uid}/inventoryMovements/{movementId}

C. sellingPrice on InventoryItem — added as var sellingPrice: Double = 0 (lightweight migration, SwiftData handles new field with default automatically, no VersionedSchema needed). Firestore sync: add sellingPrice to existing item push/pull payload.

D. Firestore paths for new models:
   users/{uid}/saleEvents/{saleId}
   users/{uid}/inventoryMovements/{movementId}
   (Both at top level under uid, not nested under storages, since they reference items cross-storage and need independent queryability for Reports.)

E. CurrencyManager propagation fix — InventoryAppView already creates @StateObject private var currencyManager = CurrencyManager() and MainAppContent receives it as @StateObject. The fix is to propagate it via .environmentObject() to ALL tabs in MainAppContent, and to fix DashboardView which currently creates its OWN @StateObject private var currencyManager (line 21 of DashboardView.swift). DashboardView must be changed to @EnvironmentObject var currencyManager: CurrencyManager.

F. Dead stock / never-audited grace periods — the fix lives in SmartInsightsCard or wherever the "dead stock" / "never audited" filter logic computes. Add createdAt guard: items must be > 30 days old for dead stock, > 7 days old for never-audited.

CRITICAL RULES — include in every implementation step:
- ALWAYS use modelContext.safeSave(context: "DescriptiveName") — NEVER try? modelContext.save()
- When deleting items, INSERT ActivityEvent BEFORE calling modelContext.delete()
- Barcode scanner uses .fullScreenCover NEVER .sheet
- smartFormatted for quantities, %.2f for currency display only (or preferably currencyManager.formatPrice())
- ItemDetailView must NOT have its own NavigationStack
- AddStorageView already has its own NavigationStack — never double-wrap
- New sheets use .sheetStyle()
- NEVER include isPro = true in any spec item
- All monetary display must use currencyManager.formatPrice(amount) — never hardcode "$"
- SaleEvent.quantitySold and all price fields on new models must be Double, never Int

